    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong><u>Polytopia Island</u></strong>, an immersive survival adventure where every decision shapes your journey. Spawn on a desolate beach and explore a world filled with diverse biomes, including scorching deserts, frozen winterlands, and lush forests. Gather essential resources like iron, lead, gold, and silver to craft tools, build shelters, and thrive in this open-world sandbox.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435890/extras/97321ce71ea5e65b7a37cf1d2da75742.avif?t=1751331487\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on thrilling quests, such as uncovering secrets hidden in abandoned housing developments, battling zombie hordes, and unlocking blueprints for advanced crafting stations. Whether you choose to survive alone or collaborate with friends, Polytopia offers endless possibilities and challenges in a vibrant, ever-evolving environment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Are you ready to carve out your path and conquer the wilds of Polytopia?</strong></u></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong><u>Polytopia Island</u></strong>, an immersive survival adventure where every decision shapes your journey. Spawn on a desolate beach and explore a world filled with diverse biomes, including scorching deserts, frozen winterlands, and lush forests. Gather essential resources like iron, lead, gold, and silver to craft tools, build shelters, and thrive in this open-world sandbox.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435890/extras/97321ce71ea5e65b7a37cf1d2da75742.avif?t=1751331487\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on thrilling quests, such as uncovering secrets hidden in abandoned housing developments, battling zombie hordes, and unlocking blueprints for advanced crafting stations. Whether you choose to survive alone or collaborate with friends, Polytopia offers endless possibilities and challenges in a vibrant, ever-evolving environment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Are you ready to carve out your path and conquer the wilds of Polytopia?</strong></u></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
